[en.DECISION_C18_SMUGGLING_CASE_KIRIN_BLOSSOM_BURST]
Investigate §YBlossom Burst§!

[en.DECISION_C18_SMUGGLING_CASE_KIRIN_BLOSSOM_BURST_desc]
Blossom Burst has already fled the country, but we can still investigate her social connections to see if she has any conspirators in the central or local government.

[zh.DECISION_C18_SMUGGLING_CASE_KIRIN_BLOSSOM_BURST]
调查§Y繁花§!

[zh.DECISION_C18_SMUGGLING_CASE_KIRIN_BLOSSOM_BURST_desc]
繁花已经潜逃出境，但我们依然可以通过她的社会关系排查她是否有在中央或者地方的共谋者。
